Song Title: Blessed Assurance (My King is Coming)
Artist / Author:
Writers: Fanny Jane Crosby, Matthew West, Pete Kipley, Phoebe Palmer Knapp
Release year:
CCLI song #: 6527149
Order: Verse 1, Chorus, Verse 2, Chorus, Bridge, Bridge, Chorus

Verse 1
Blessed assurance, Jesus is mine
Oh what a foretaste of glory divine
Heir of salvation, purchase of God
Born of His Spirit and washed in His blood

Chorus
This is my story, this is my song
Praising my Saviour all the day long
This is my story, this is my song
Praising my Saviour all the day long

Verse 2
Perfect submission, all is at rest
I in my Saviour am happy and blessed
Watching and waiting, looking above
Filled with His goodness and lost in His love

Chorus
This is my story, this is my song
Praising my Saviour all the day long
This is my story, this is my song
Praising my Saviour all the day long

Bridge
My King is coming soon
He will roll the clouds away
Light of heaven bursting through
O what a glorious day
Yes, my King is coming soon
He will roll the clouds away
Light of heaven bursting through
And until that glorious day

Bridge
My King is coming soon
He will roll the clouds away
Light of heaven bursting through
O what a glorious day
Yes, my King is coming soon
He will roll the clouds away
Light of heaven bursting through
And until that glorious day

Chorus
This is my story, this is my song
Praising my Saviour all the day long
